# openapi.json is COMMITTED (Phase 7D.3 §3). The Zod schemas in
# src/researchApi/contracts/ remain the source of truth, but the generated
# document is the published contract: scripts/check-openapi-drift.mjs compares
# the two in CI, and the frontend pins a copy to generate its API types. A
# disposable local copy would let those silently diverge, which is exactly what
# happened in 7D.2 (snapshot documented 18 fields, route returned 29).

# Supervised dev-stack runtime state (scripts/dev-stack.sh)
.run/
